# Cloudflare Pages response headers: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Until launch day nothing is indexed: on production (the soft launch), staging and previews alike.
# At launch, delete the X-Robots-Tag line and set PUBLIC_NOINDEX=false in Cloudflare's production variables.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
